@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Share link creation and access through its owner
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Owner
participant "Representation / Sharing" as R
participant Files as F
actor Viewer
Owner -> R : explicitly create permitted link for exact representation
R -> R : current authority / source-defined link controls
R -> F : establish exact usable artifact / required protection
F --> R : attributable protection / actual availability
R --> Owner : actual eligible link or truthful unavailable state
Viewer -> R : access link
R -> R : re-evaluate current link and resource eligibility
R -> F : guarded exact delivery request if eligible
F --> Viewer : permitted controlled bytes or safe unavailable/denied

@enduml